  "passageHtml": "<h2>READING PASSAGE 2</h2><h3>Multilingualism in India</h3><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q14' data-q='[Q14]'>Delhi... as <span class='kw'>more than 20 million people</span> go about their daily lives</span>. <span class='hl' id='hl-q15-17' data-q='[Q15-17]'>Many were born and raised here, and <span class='kw'>many millions more have recently made India's capital their home</span>, having moved from <span class='kw'>surrounding neighbourhoods</span>... in hope of <span class='kw'>gaining better jobs and a better life</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q18-19' data-q='[Q18-19]'>The <span class='kw'>overriding aim</span> of the four-year project... is to find out why... the <span class='kw'>many benefits observed in Europe do not apply</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q20' data-q='[Q20]'>over 50% cannot read... and <span class='kw'>just under 50% cannot solve subtraction</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q22' data-q='[Q22]'>investigating whether low learning outcomes caused by language that <span class='kw'>differs from language used at home</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q23' data-q='[Q23]'>They intend to look not only at test results, but also at variables such as... <span class='kw'>teaching practices themselves</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q24' data-q='[Q24]'>evidence shows that <span class='kw'>English instruction for children from low socio-economic areas might not be the best way</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q25' data-q='[Q25]'>We are not suggesting English be withdrawn - <span class='kw'>that ship has sailed</span></span>.</p><p><span class='hl' id='hl-q26' data-q='[Q26]'><span class='kw'>children from slum backgrounds do not seem to lag behind children from other urban poor backgrounds</span></span>.</p>",
  "questionHtml": "<div class='section-title'>Questions 14-19</div><div class='question' id='q14'>Delhi has a <b>14.</b> <input type='text' id='q14_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> I (dense population)</div></div><div class='question' id='q15'>others are <b>15.</b> <input type='text' id='q15_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> J (new immigrants)</div></div><div class='question' id='q16'>from a <b>16.</b> <input type='text' id='q16_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> H (nearby district)</div></div><div class='question' id='q17'>improved <b>17.</b> <input type='text' id='q17_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> B (employment opportunities)</div></div><div class='question' id='q18'>The <b>18.</b> <input type='text' id='q18_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> E (primary objective)</div></div><div class='question' id='q19'>do not experience <b>19.</b> <input type='text' id='q19_input' class='fill-input' maxlength='2'><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> F (similar advantages)</div></div><div class='section-title'>Questions 20-23</div><div class='question' id='q20'><p><b>20.</b> Perform better in literacy than numeracy.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q20' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q20' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q20' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NO</div></div><div class='question' id='q21'><p><b>21.</b> Problems convincing female students.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q21' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q21' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q21' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NOT GIVEN</div></div><div class='question' id='q22'><p><b>22.</b> Connection between poor performance and unfamiliar language.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q22' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q22' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q22' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> YES</div></div><div class='question' id='q23'><p><b>23.</b> Decided against investigating teaching methodology.</p><div class='options'><label><input type='radio' name='q23' value='YES'> YES</label><label><input type='radio' name='q23' value='NO'> NO</label><label><input type='radio' name='q23' value='NOT GIVEN'> NOT GIVEN</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> NO</div></div><div class='section-title'>Questions 24-26</div><div class='question' id='q24'><p><b>24.</b> Primary schools in India: <b>C.</b> Poor children may be disadvantaged further by being instructed in English</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q24' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q24' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q24' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q24' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> C</div></div><div class='question' id='q25'><p><b>25.</b> 'That ship has sailed': <b>D.</b> Too late to remove English completely</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q25' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q25' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q25' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q25' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> D</div></div><div class='question' id='q26'><p><b>26.</b> Surprised researchers: <b>D.</b> Skills of slum children not lower than other urban poor</p><div class='options-vertical'><label><input type='radio' name='q26' value='A'> A</label><label><input type='radio' name='q26' value='B'> B</label><label><input type='radio' name='q26' value='C'> C</label><label><input type='radio' name='q26' value='D'> D</label></div><div class='result'></div><div class='explanation'><b>Đáp án:</b> D</div></div><button class='btn-submit' onclick='checkAnswers()'>CHẤM BÀI VÀ NỘP KẾT QUẢ</button>"
